            "triggering_condition": "Calling SVD or symmetric eigendecomposition on a very small perturbation of the identity matrix in f32. In Householder reflection_axis_mut, the reflection factor is tiny (possibly on the scale of 1e-40). Dividing by factor.sqrt() can leave the column slightly non-unit-sized, especially in f32, and the decomposition relies strongly on the unit-vector property.",
